 "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "047aeddb31cd2630413dc9428dc9d0a7d7b07fef", "message": "Add Caesar Cipher encryption and decryption script\n\nImplemented a basic Caesar Cipher script that can encode or decode messages based on a given shift value. The script interacts with the user to obtain the text, shift value, and the direction (encode or decode). A loop allows continuous interaction until the user decides to exit.", "created_at": "2024-11-05T13:44:53Z", "repo": "100daysofprojects", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "b0dfecf122c77f179808122673fea22ace10b5a3", "message": "Add Caesar Cipher encryption and decryption script\n\nImplemented a basic Caesar Cipher script that can encode or decode messages based on a given shift value. The script interacts with the user to obtain the text, shift value, and the direction (encode or decode). A loop allows continuous interaction until the user decides to exit.", "created_at": "2024-10-31T17:33:46Z", "repo": "100daysofprojects", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "5f1a663722ca284176718c7c70564c337fee6dd1", "message": "Add Caesar Cipher encryption and decryption script\n\nImplemented a basic Caesar Cipher script that can encode or decode messages based on a given shift value. The script interacts with the user to obtain the text, shift value, and the direction (encode or decode). A loop allows continuous interaction until the user decides to exit.", "created_at": "2024-10-31T08:20:26Z", "repo": "100daysofprojects", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "2ea66fd2e03529b72e910604e12cd3ed3775cbab", "message": "Add Caesar Cipher encryption and decryption script\n\nImplemented a basic Caesar Cipher script that can encode or decode messages based on a given shift value. The script interacts with the user to obtain the text, shift value, and the direction (encode or decode). A loop allows continuous interaction until the user decides to exit.", "created_at": "2024-10-30T06:13:18Z", "repo": "100daysofprojects", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "dda744963b6e884c41008a1e44c36f00c4ea204f", "message": "Add Caesar Cipher encryption and decryption script\n\nImplemented a basic Caesar Cipher script that can encode or decode messages based on a given shift value. The script interacts with the user to obtain the text, shift value, and the direction (encode or decode). A loop allows continuous interaction until the user decides to exit.", "created_at": "2024-10-08T15:43:37Z", "repo": "100daysofprojects", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "78e2978129cbcf2c5fc5492142a8ef54df8eb0b7", "message": "Add initial Hangman game implementation\n\nCreated a basic Hangman game script that allows players to guess letters and accumulate correct guesses. The game provides feedback on guessed letters, reduces lives for incorrect guesses, and ends when the word is guessed or lives are depleted. Includes initial setup with logo and word list.", "created_at": "2024-10-06T09:50:43Z", "repo": "100daysofprojects", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "8464cb45a753b1f164d0181be5f64207f02a50d6", "message": "Create password generator script\n\nAdded a new password generator script that includes easy and hard versions. The hard version ensures better randomness by shuffling characters before combining them into the final password string. User input is required for the number of letters, symbols, and numbers.", "created_at": "2024-10-02T15:11:11Z", "repo": "100daysofprojects", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "c7cd77914910384617eae9f4e242e68e1bd5e297", "message": "Add rock-paper-scissors game implementation\n\nImplemented a simple rock-paper-scissors game with user input and random computer choice. Added visual representations for rock, paper, and scissors, and logic to determine the winner based on the choices. It handles invalid inputs and displays corresponding messages.", "created_at": "2024-10-02T10:43:50Z", "repo": "100daysofprojects", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "e4239996ad358948b32c95a10494410ba171a4d9", "message": "Add initial pathfinding game script\n\nThis script initiates a text-based treasure hunting game. Users make directional choices to navigate a map, aiming to find the treasure while avoiding game-ending paths. It includes multiple decision points and outputs end-of-game messages based on the player's choices.", "created_at": "2024-09-29T15:58:13Z", "repo": "100daysofprojects", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "12f4bd810634c97476dbfd1153bae2b1fc0a7110", "message": "Add initial tip calculator script\n\nThis script calculates the total bill per person, including the tip, and divides it among the specified number of people. It asks for the total bill, the desired tip percentage, and the number of people to split the cost.", "created_at": "2024-09-29T05:44:10Z", "repo": "100daysofprojects", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "e8874cd15e43ceea7777a5009beff95f6e0e2331", "message": "project1", "created_at": "2024-09-29T05:35:12Z", "repo": "100daysofprojects", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "2f27ed209812226806952e6dd7a86a36fafcda4f", "message": "Add files via upload", "created_at": "2024-09-28T15:52:32Z", "repo": "100daysofprojects", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "25803d56064057665d2ed1723f1d34e7b7f8f64d", "message": "Add files via upload", "created_at": "2024-09-28T15:44:40Z", "repo": "100daysofprojects", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "24944570ca910d312cad9b3e9137173a6d85b6fd", "message